* '''Route 5''' → ''mods/tuxemon/maps/classic_route_5.tmx''
* '''Aerolume City''' → ''mods/tuxemon/maps/classic_aerolume_city.tmx''
* '''Route 6''' → ''mods/tuxemon/maps/classic_route_6.tmx''
* '''Umbrastar City''' → ''mods/tuxemon/maps/classic_umbrastar_city.tmx''

=== Northern branch (from Thornwood to Stormpeak) ===
* '''Route 3''' → ''mods/tuxemon/maps/classic_route_3.tmx''
* '''Route 4''' → ''mods/tuxemon/maps/classic_route_4.tmx''
* '''Stormpeak City''' → ''mods/tuxemon/maps/classic_stormpeak_city.tmx''

=== Southern loop (Hearthrock ↔ Valorhold) ===
* '''Route 8''' → ''mods/tuxemon/maps/classic_route_8.tmx''
* '''Valorhold City''' → ''mods/tuxemon/maps/classic_valorhold_city.tmx''
* '''Route 7''' → ''mods/tuxemon/maps/classic_route_7.tmx''

